# Diving with the hands as they hold the controllers (a tester on 0.1.16, seated: "Diving isnt working for me. Can't get
# below the water no matter what I try"). Run seated (QUEST_VR_OPTIONS=seated 1) and standing. Ratchet put in Novalis's
# water treads it at the surface. The hands, edge-on to the water (no turn of the palms), pushed up quick: he dives
# ([vr-swim] dive: the hands pushed up). Looking up with the stick he comes back up. At the surface, the head 50 degrees
# down, a stroke back dives him again ([vr-swim] dive: a stroke looking down). QUEST_SWIM_TRACE=1: the hands' heights to
# the water at the surface ([vr-swim] at the surface), which must be under it (below 0).
600 y 1
606 y 0
3300 shot treading
# The hands down, then up 2 cm a frame (1.2 m/s each), palms edge-on.
3320 rh_y -0.40
3320 lh_y -0.40
3340 rh_y -0.38
3340 lh_y -0.38
3341 rh_y -0.36
3341 lh_y -0.36
3342 rh_y -0.34
3342 lh_y -0.34
3343 rh_y -0.32
3343 lh_y -0.32
3344 rh_y -0.30
3344 lh_y -0.30
3345 rh_y -0.28
3345 lh_y -0.28
3346 rh_y -0.26
3346 lh_y -0.26
3347 rh_y -0.24
3347 lh_y -0.24
3348 rh_y -0.22
3348 lh_y -0.22
3349 rh_y -0.20
3349 lh_y -0.20
3420 shot dived
# Back where they were, under the water by now (the dive's tick, in the state trace, before 3350).
3430 rh_y 0
3430 lh_y 0
# Up again: look up and push the stick.
3440 head_pitch 40
3460 left_y 1
3640 left_y 0
3650 head_pitch 0
3700 shot surfaced
# Looking down, a stroke back: both hands 3 cm a frame back (1.8 m/s each), down in the water first.
3710 rh_y -0.30
3710 lh_y -0.30
3720 head_pitch -50
3740 rh_z 0.03
3740 lh_z 0.03
3741 rh_z 0.06
3741 lh_z 0.06
3742 rh_z 0.09
3742 lh_z 0.09
3743 rh_z 0.12
3743 lh_z 0.12
3744 rh_z 0.15
3744 lh_z 0.15
3745 rh_z 0.18
3745 lh_z 0.18
3746 rh_z 0.21
3746 lh_z 0.21
3747 rh_z 0.24
3747 lh_z 0.24
3820 shot dived-again
3830 rh_z 0
3830 lh_z 0
3830 head_pitch 0
3850 rh_y 0
3850 lh_y 0
3900 quit 0
